            <li>Donations are voluntary and non-refundable (see <a href="/refunds">Refund Policy</a>)</li>
            <li>Credits purchased through donations can be used for in-game services</li>
            <li>We do not guarantee the availability of any specific items or services</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>6. Account Termination</h3>
        <p>We reserve the right to suspend or terminate your account if you violate these Terms of Service.</p>

        <h3>7. Server Availability</h3>
        <p>We do not guarantee uninterrupted server availability. We may perform maintenance or updates at any time.</p>

        <h3>8. Modifications to Terms</h3>
        <p>We reserve the right to modify these Terms of Service at any time. Continued use of the service constitutes acceptance of the modified terms.</p>

        <h3>9. Disclaimer</h3>
        <p>The service is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. We are not liable for any damages arising from your use of the service.</p>

        <h3>10. Contact</h3>
        <p>For questions about these Terms of Service, please <a href="/contact">contact us</a>.</p>

        <p class="text-muted"><small>Last updated: {{ "now"|date("Y-m-d") }}</small></p>
    </div>
</div>
{% endblock %}
